*> PLB-K014 return-not-top-level: RETURN with COMMAREA, CHANNEL, or
*> IMMEDIATE in a program that a LINK of the run names.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTMENU.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-AREA             PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM('ACCTCHK') COMMAREA(WS-AREA) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM('ACCTLOG') COMMAREA(WS-AREA) END-EXEC
    *> Not reported: ACCTMENU is not linked to, and ACCTSHOW is only
    *> transferred to.
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('ACCTSHOW') COMMAREA(WS-AREA) END-EXEC.
END PROGRAM ACCTMENU.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTCHK.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01  DFHCOMMAREA         PIC X(20).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Reported: the first RETURN with COMMAREA.
    IF EIBCALEN = 0
        EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('ACCT') COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
        END-EXEC
    END-IF
    EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('ACCT') IMMEDIATE END-EXEC.
END PROGRAM ACCTCHK.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTLOG.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Not reported: a RETURN with TRANSID alone is allowed here.
    EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('ACCT') END-EXEC.
END PROGRAM ACCTLOG.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTSHOW.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01  DFHCOMMAREA         PIC X(20).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('ACCT') COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA) END-EXEC.
END PROGRAM ACCTSHOW.
